This directory includes the Perl script that can generate all the necessary files for synthesis and simulation, and for TVLA. Its usage is given as follows:

Usage:       perl kalyna.pl -f=<FileName> -m=<String> -k=<String> -bs=128/256/512 -kl=128/256/512 -p=0/1 -s=0/1 -c=0/1 -o=<FileName>                                                                                    
                            -tb -not=<Integer> -dut=<String> -clk=<Integer> -tm=enc/dec/encdec -rst=low/high -par -gl -sf=SAIF/VCD -sdc                                                                                 
                            -tvla -pt=innovus/primetime -g0t=0-1 g1t=0-5 -step=<Integer> -st=<Integer> -no_synth                                                                                                        
                            -gv=19/23 -rm -v -h                                                                                                                                                                         
f:           File including the message in hexadecimal format                                                                                                                                                           
m:           Message in hexadecimal format                                                                                                                                                                              
k:           Secret key in hexadecimal format                                                                                                                                                                           
bs:          Block size by default it is 128                                                                                                                                                                            
kl:          Key length by default it is 128                                                                                                                                                                            
p:           Process by default it is encryption                                                                                                                                                                        
               0: Encryption                                                                                                                                                                                            
               1: Decryption                                                                                                                                                                                            
c:           MixColumn implementation by default it is generic                                                                                                                                                          
               0: Generic                                                                                                                                                                                               
               1: Optimized                                                                                                                                                                                             
s:           S-Box implementation by default it is original                                                                                                                                                             
               0: Original                                                                                                                                                                                              
               1: Alternative                                                                                                                                                                                           
o:           Output file                                                                                                                                                                                                
tb:          Runs the random test vector generation by default it does not                                                                                                                                              
not:         Number of test vectors by default it is 1000                                                                                                                                                               
dut:         Name of the design under test by default it is kalyna_enc_block_serial                                                                                                                                     
clk:         Clock period in ns by default it is 10                                                                                                                                                                     
tm:          Mode of the cipher while generating the test vectors by default it is encryption                                                                                                                           
rst:         Reset signal by default is active high                                                                                                                                                                     
par:         Considers the parallel design of the KALYNA block by default it does not                                                                                                                                   
gl:          Considers the simulation at gate-level by default it does not                                                                                                                                              
sf:          Stimuli format by default it is SAIF                                                                                                                                                                       
sdc:         Considers the SDC data while obtaining the gate-level synthesis results by default it does not                                                                                                             
tvla:        Generates test vectors for the leakage assessment by default it does not                                                                                                                                   
pt:          Tool used for the generation of power traces when tvla is set by default it is innovus                                                                                                                     
g0t:         Technique to generate group 0 \"not\" test vectors when tvla is set by default it is 1                                                                                                                     
               0: Random plaintext with a fixed key                                                                                                                                                                     
               1: Random plaintext with a random key                                                                                                                                                                    
g1t:         Technique to generate group 1 test vectors when tvla is set by default it is 5                                                                                                                             
               0: 1 specific plaintext with a fixed key                                                                                                                                                                 
               1: 10 specific plaintext with a fixed key                                                                                                                                                                
               2: 100 specific plaintext with a fixed key                                                                                                                                                               
               3: 1 specific plaintext with a random key                                                                                                                                                                
               4: 10 specific plaintext with a random key                                                                                                                                                               
               5: 100 specific plaintext with a random key                                                                                                                                                              
step:        The interval in ns used to obtain power traces when tvla and innovus are set by default it is 1                                                                                                            
st:          Total simulation time used to obtain power traces when tvla and innovus are set by default it is 1935                                                                                                      
no_synth:    Does not synthesize the block cipher when tvla is set by default it does                                                                                                                                   
gv:          Cadence Genus version by default it is the 2023 EDA version                                                                                                                                                
rm:          Removes unnecessary files by default it does not                                                                                                                                                           
v:           Prints comments during execution by default it does not                                                                                                                                                    
h:           Prints this screen                                                                                                                                                                                         
Description: This code implements KALYNA in software                                                                                                                                                                    
             If the message is shorter than the block size then 0s are added                                                                                                                                            
             The decryption process has not been implemented yet                                                                                                                                                        
Examples:    perl kalyna.pl -f=msg128.txt -k=000102030405060708090A0B0C0D0E0F -p=0 -v                           *Encryption from the message file                                                                       
             perl kalyna.pl -m=101112131415161718191A1B1C1D1E1F -k=000102030405060708090a0B0C0D0E0F -p=0 -v     *Encryption from the command prompt                                                                     
             perl kalyna.pl -tb -dut=kalyna_enc_block_serial64b_oboc -tm=enc -gl                                *Generation of all the necessary files and scripts for synthesis and simulation in encryption           
             perl kalyna.pl -tb -dut=kalyna_dec_block_serial64b_oboc -tm=dec -gl                                *Generation of all the necessary files and scripts for synthesis and simulation in decryption           
             perl kalyna.pl -tb -dut=kalyna_encdec_block_serial64b_oboc -tm=encdec -gl                          *Generation of all the necessary files and scripts for synthesis and simulation in encryption/decryption
             perl kalyna.pl -tvla -dut=kalyna_encdec_block_serial64b_oboc_fomhidtemdup -tm=encdec -st=7655      *Generation of all the necessary files and scripts for TVLA in encryption/decryption                    
